/paymentTermsLink> and the undertaking of risk assessment. You also agree that your information (such as address, name and date of birth) will be shared in accordance with the <dataProtectionLink>supplementary data protection information</dataProtectionLink>.\",\"upe.redirectMessage\":\"After submitting your order, you will be redirected to securely complete your purchase.\",\"upe.redirectMessage_v2\":\"After submission, you will be redirected to securely complete next steps.\",\"upe.redirectMessage.ng_wallet.terms_link\":\"terms\",\"upe.redirectMessage.ng_wallet\":\"By confirming your payment, you agree that your transaction will be handled by Global Stack Services Limited as merchant of record and in accordance with their {terms_link}.\",\"upe.redirectMessage.kr_card\":\"After submission, you will be redirected to NICEPAY to select your card issuer and complete the transaction securely. NICEPAY will process the transaction per its {terms_link} in Korean Won, without currency conversion or FX fees from your card provider.\",\"upe.redirectMessage.kr_card.link_text\":\"terms of use\",\"upe.redirectMessage.kakao_pay\":\"After submission, you will be redirected to Kakao Pay to securely complete next steps. This transaction will be processed via NICEPAY in accordance with NICEPAY’s {terms_link}.\",\"upe.redirectMessage.kakao_pay.link_text\":\"terms of use\",\"upe.redirectMessage.naver_pay\":\"After submission, you will be redirected to Naver Pay to securely complete next steps. This transaction will be processed via NICEPAY in accordance with NICEPAY’s {terms_link}.\",\"upe.redirectMessage.naver_pay.link_text\":\"terms of use\",\"upe.redirectMessage.nigeria_paystack\":\"By confirming your payment, you agree that your transaction will be handled by Global Stack Services Limited as merchant of record and in accordance with their {terms_link}.\",\"upe.redirectMessage.nigeria_paystack.link_text\":\"terms of use\",\"upe.redirectMessage.payco\":\"After submission, you will be